    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u4e09\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_wild_m",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_loop",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you had a rough time as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, what happened here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We were ambushed by Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were caught in a withering assault with no reinforcements. They easily routed our forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And Misha...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She was taken away by a woman dressed in red.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I really should have...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nevermind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, why is Misha so special?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you keep hiding things from us, it's only going to be harder and harder for us to continue working together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no obligation to tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But Rhodes Island has an obligation to understand the objectives and prepare our strategies accordingly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally, we'll continue to follow the L.G.D.'s instructions during our operations...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, when it comes to using the Infected to fight other Infected, we need all the information we can get.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "While you may have that information, you don't have the means of using it effectively to reduce your losses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the other hand, we have the ability to stop Reunion, but we don't know what they're after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sounded a bit like that doctor just now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is, is that so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is something that is equally important to both of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's because you need to ask for permission from Chief Wei...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When we investigated Misha, the most prominent bit of information was that her father was one of Chernobog's most influential people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha's father?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally, we don't know how much Misha knows about Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "She could know nothing, or she could know everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody knows...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...except her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We also have no idea what kind of information she might have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you predicted that Lungmen would be Reunion's next target...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's obvious that we have to prevent Reunion from using Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why we can't allow them to have Misha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were aware of the fact that someone who fit her descriptions had taken refuge in Lungmen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "But until you actually found her, we weren't able to verify if that intel was accurate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the case, we can't waste any more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to stop Reunion and rescue Misha before they're able to take her back to Chernobog!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island, prepare to move out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the L.G.D.'s responsibility to track her down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and letting Reunion capture her was a dereliction of our duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rather than lauching a joint operation, we'll need Rhodes Island to eliminate other threats from Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is an order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let me down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-no! D-don't beat me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should've thought twice before entering Lungmen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaagh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lock them all up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not with this group of Infected. Curses...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not with this group either... Damn it all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "They... retreated way too quickly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just who are they...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam! We found some Reunion stragglers over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Follow me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful, Madam Ch'en!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's an ambush!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "G-go to hell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get in my way--!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, we're still on Lungmen soil!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "The nearby facilities can still be used, so please try not to cause too much damage!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, don't cut these buildings to pieces!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
